{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24647","headline":"醉中得上都亲友书以予停俸多时忧问贫乏偶乘酒兴咏而报之 · 白居易","name":"醉中得上都亲友书以予停俸多时忧问贫乏偶乘酒兴咏而报之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"头白醉昏昏，狂歌秋复春。\n一生躭酒客，五度弃官人。\n异世陶元亮，前生刘伯伦。\n卧将琴作枕，行以锸随身。\n岁要衣三对，年支谷一囷。\n园葵烹佐饭，林叶扫添薪。\n没齿甘蔬食，摇头谢缙绅。\n自能抛爵禄，终不恼交亲。\n但得杯中渌，从生甑上尘。\n烦君问生计，忧醒不忧贫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24647.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24647","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}